# Ruthless Radrat: "Squad-Exile four cards from your graveyard." (CR 702.157a) is optional, and payable only while four cards can
# be exiled (CR 601.2b, 118.3). With three Dark Rituals in Bot1's graveyard it can't be paid even once, so the Radrat can't
# be kicked, and cast without paying it enters alone: no token is made (CR 702.157a), nothing is exiled and the graveyard
# is as it was. It is a 2/2 black Rat Mutant with menace, and the only Radrat on the battlefield.

